# Stage-1 grey configuration: today's zie1/zie3 production settings (runs/zie{1,3}/run.env, deduplicated: the LAST value of a repeated key,
# as the shell `env` applies them) with the run-specific mesh (ENVEUL/ENVCORE: cases/z100.env, cases/z298.env) and SNAPEVERY (set by the
# gate runner) removed. phaseB.env of zie1/zie3 is empty. NKRYLOV=1 TITAN_NOLIB=1 TITAN_MGR=600 are in. TRTOL true-residual convergence
# is a code constant (Trbdf2.TRTOL = 1), not an env key. No convection switch is set (MLT/TDC off) = production behaviour.
# Format: KEY=VALUE words, any whitespace, '#' starts a comment. Read by common.sh (gate_config); override with gate.sh --config.
